        "about_content": "<p>My name is Andrii and I am a web developer based in Krakow (PL). I work with companies and individuals from different countries.</p>\n<p>I develop complex dynamic websites that will help you to maximize profits. I provide intuitive user interface and maximum scalability for each kind of business. I believe in the power of the net and I will guide you step by step in order to improve your online presence. Together we will transform local challenge into global challenge. That&#8217;s what I do.</p>\n<p>When it comes to using technology, education is important, so I will help you understand and control your online presence. More you know, more you can maximize your business\u2019s online potential. Let&#8217;s work together and we will succeed!</p>\n",
